# program cc_i2c_read_reg  (281 image bytes)
# source: ~/Documents/protocol-emulator/test/cocotb_tests/protocols.py:i2c_write_then_read
# Write register 0x0B to device 0x4B, repeated START, read 1 byte.
# RX: address ACK, register ACK, read-address ACK, data (ACK 0 = acknowledged).
# Default part: ADT7420 temperature sensor (Digilent Pmod TMP2), ID = 0xCB.
# Edit DEV/REG in tools/cocotb_programs.py for another part.

test read_id_register
needs i2c_0x4b I2C device at 0x4B (SCL uio2, SDA uio3, with pull-ups)
reset
drain 1
loop 00000000
cmds 
rx 0 4 100000 000000cb
end
